{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 7, :comments ["<b>And make atonement for yourself and for the people.</b> For it is a commandment that you make atonement for your own soul and for the whole congregation: with the bull of the sin-offering you make atonement for yourself, and afterward you offer the people's sacrifice and make atonement for them, for no person can make atonement for another until he himself is clean from all sin."], :book :leviticus, :voice :ibn-ezra, :lang :en, :chapter 9, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [["On Your Way" "http://mobile.tora.ws/"]], :timestamp "2026-07-09T19:09:10.826022838Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}